&lt;h2&gt;Preferred Qualifications and Certifications&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Degree in Mechanical or Electrical Engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
